v0.14.0 release — a policy you can read without a model: `.agent/orchestration.md` gains a canonical form that `kapel policy compile` parses instead of compiling, so a fresh project sets itself up with no model call and no provider credential at all; `kapel policy edit` and `/policy` edit the policy IR directly and write both the file and its lock, and prose policies still compile through an LLM exactly as before
